Focuses on understanding how text is converted into smaller units called tokens.
Implements three tokenization techniques: BPE, WordPiece and SentencePiece.
Uses GPT-2, Multilingual BERT and XLM-R pretrained tokenizers.
Tests the tokenizers using English, Telugu and Hindi sentences.
Observes how each tokenizer divides the same sentence into smaller pieces.
Compares token pieces, token IDs and total token counts.

Output: A comparison of all three tokenizers showing their tokens, numeric IDs and token counts for each language.
